{"4380020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "It’s magic, bro!", "steam_appid": 4380020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cooperative fantasy horror where you and your bros must deliver a wagon of magical artifacts to the enchanted kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT MONSTERS AND GATHER LOOT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the road to the enchanted kingdom, your cart will frequently break down, making you easy prey for monsters. Destroy them and remember to search abandoned villages for spellbooks or artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>USE YOUR VOICE NOT ONLY FOR SPELLS, BUT ALSO TO CONTROL THE CART</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, in this game you must cast spells with your voice. Aim at monsters (or your bros), and remember that the main goal is to reach the kingdom. But the horse won't budge until you command it to. It will stand there even if skeletons are eating it...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A WIDE SELECTION OF SPELLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can hurl fireballs, or you can freeze your enemies. If you want to cast spells from the air, you can grab a broom and take flight! And if a powerful enemy appears—cast meteor shower!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cooperative fantasy horror where you and your bros must deliver a wagon of magical artifacts to the enchanted kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT MONSTERS AND GATHER LOOT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the road to the enchanted kingdom, your cart will frequently break down, making you easy prey for monsters. Destroy them and remember to search abandoned villages for spellbooks or artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>USE YOUR VOICE NOT ONLY FOR SPELLS, BUT ALSO TO CONTROL THE CART</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, in this game you must cast spells with your voice. Aim at monsters (or your bros), and remember that the main goal is to reach the kingdom. But the horse won't budge until you command it to. It will stand there even if skeletons are eating it...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A WIDE SELECTION OF SPELLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can hurl fireballs, or you can freeze your enemies. If you want to cast spells from the air, you can grab a broom and take flight! And if a powerful enemy appears—cast meteor shower!</p>", "short_description": "🧙‍♂️🔥💀 Cooperative fantasy horror where you and your bros must deliver a wagon of magical artifacts to the enchanted kingdom. Repair the cart, fight monsters, gather loot, and SHOUT SPELL NAMES INTO YOUR MIC!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380020/fed54a768ff66f57f03a9bb87c6ec369ae5c2bf0/header.jpg?t=1771325332", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380020/284f23cb7c837e28a56a422b7713d5f372a3dc13/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771325332", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380020/284f23cb7c837e28a56a422b7713d5f372a3dc13/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771325332", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5 6600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 970</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["INDIE ALESHA"], "publishers": ["INDIE ALESHA"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 78, "description": "Adjustable D